# The fleet's server list. Copy this file to scripts/servers.local (one checkout)
# or to ~/.config/fleet/servers (every checkout on this machine) and replace the
# lines below with your own servers. `npm run servers:export` writes it for you
# from the dashboard's database.
#
#   <ip address>|<GridPane server id>|<label>
#
# The id is the number GridPane gives the server; the label is the server's name
# in GridPane. Add |golden to the ONE server the install scripts copy their
# known-good files from.
#
# Your SSH key: before connecting, the scripts check that your ssh-agent holds
# the key the servers accept. Name that key by its fingerprint (`ssh-add -l`
# prints it, the part that starts SHA256:) in ~/.config/fleet/ssh-key-fingerprint,
# or in $FLEET_SSH_KEY_FP. With neither set, any key the agent holds will do.
#
# These addresses are examples (they are reserved for documentation and reach
# nothing).
203.0.113.10|10001|web1|golden
203.0.113.11|10002|web2
203.0.113.12|10003|shop1
